Z||000009||Doni Hagan||07-21-2001||12:48 AM||||You guys are psychic. I was just about to ask the same "holey" question! I sold my wing last night and plan on replacing it with an aftermarket one as soon as I find one I really like. I want to glass the holes up, though, as I doubt the new one will fit in existing holes. ||||reg||1
